'' A missing header is TKO0336 at the directive, with clang's own line and where a named
'' header is looked for.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -cnocache tests/cimport/src/cinclude-missing.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: cinclude-missing.bas(3,1): error TKO0336: unable to import C header tests/cimport/src/ci/no-such.h
